            description: Some("Creates a new Neptune ML inference endpoint that lets you query one specific model that the model-training process constructed. See Managing inference endpoints using the endpoints command. When invoking this operation in a Neptune cluster that has IAM authentication enabled, the IAM user or role making the request must have a policy attached that allows the neptune-db:CreateMLEndpoint IAM action in that cluster"),
            options: [
                (
                    names: [
